%% Step 5       : HTTP contract (multipart + X-User-Id) ......... FR-1, AC-20
%% Steps 6-7    : Controller ordering (header then file) ........ design section 2, AC-8
%% Step 8       : Caller-existence check ........................ FR-4, AC-9
%% Step 9       : objectKey layout .............................. FR-3, AC-16
%% Step 10-11   : Object-storage write .......................... FR-3, AC-15
%% Happy path   : DB insert + 201 response ...................... FR-4, AC-6
%% alt branch 1 : Compensating delete on DB failure ............. FR-5, AC-14
%% alt branch 2 : Validation failure example .................... FR-2, AC-13,
%%                (maps UC-01 alt-flow 1-a at upload time)       spec section 2 / PRD section 6
%%
%% Error-code envelope shape (FR-6):
%%   { errorCode, message, correlationId } - handled by UploadExceptionAdvice.
%% All 8 codes (EMPTY_FILE, MISSING_USER_HEADER, UNKNOWN_USER,
%% UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE, FILE_TOO_LARGE, IMAGE_UNREADABLE,
%% RESOLUTION_TOO_LOW, STORAGE_PERSIST_FAILED) route through the same envelope.
